  "description_original": "Smaller 2 bed apartment, 52m2, on the first floor, located in Kalimanj (Tivat). The apartment is fully furnished. It has AC and terrace. Orientation is south-north. Available parking space in front of the building.\nApartment is located 5 minutes on foot from the center of Tivat. Within 200m from the apartment there are two markets, one small fruit and vegetable shop and bakery.\nThe nearest beach is about 500m from the apartment, one in the center of Tivat and other one Belani beach.\nThe building where the apartment is located is close to the main road, but there is no noise polution.\nIdeal for a family of four. The utilities are not included in the price. Apartment is for LONG TERM rent (min. 1 year)\nSmoking is not allowed inside of the apartment, only on the terrace. Pets are not allowed.",
